    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> NOW COMPLETELY FREE\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full-scale Video, Image, Audio and Animation editor and sequencer with AI features, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * 300+ video and image gpu-accelerated effects and transitions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * H.264/H265/VP9 support, up to 8K rendering, GPU acceleratred, HDR </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Animation, Automation, Lottie, 360 image and 3D support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Advanced audio features (VST 2.x, 3.x, Compression, Equalizer, Modulation, Filter and other known effects)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Advanced ASIO support with bundled driver</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Including 8+GB orchestra</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Paid versions include unlimited polymorphic tracks (Free version - 1 track)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Intelligent OpenCV features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * OCR features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * PDF features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * HDR editing features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Artificial Intelligence in Image, Audio and Video editing (using MIT-licensed models).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > * Multiple interface languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Steam special version: up to 3 full-featured layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* HDR features</p>",
